<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We come together—there’s nothing better—</l><l>For in the Spirit we are His family,</l><l>His living Body!</l><l>We just express Him.</l><l>Jesus is our reality.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In all the churches we’re being filled now</l><l>For the saturation throughout the nation,</l><l>To spread our Jesus</l><l>To every city—</l><l>This land will see the living Christ.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
